{
  "uid": "coupon-benchmark-evidence",
  "title": "Coupon Benchmarks: Historical Evidence",
  "tags": [
    "coupon",
    "benchmark",
    "historical"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Read this first",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Historical local k6 results, recorded 2026-09-16.** These gauges are fixed snapshots, not a live load test or production SLO. Mac ARM 16 GiB / 10 CPU, Colima 4 CPU / 4 GiB, one hot coupon and warm cache. The synchronous HTTP response includes issuance; the MQ HTTP response measures **acceptance only**. Run outcomes and limits: [performance evidence](https://github.com/aimee-RH/distributed-coupon-system/blob/main/docs/performance.md).",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Target vs achieved HTTP requests / second",
      "description": "Observed throughput counts completed HTTP requests over the measured duration. Configured arrival rate is not achieved throughput.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_target_requests_per_second",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} target",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_observed_requests_per_second",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} observed",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#5B8DEF"
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Synchronous HTTP P99",
      "description": "Exploratory target was below 200 ms. The repeat run failed despite matching the first run's configured 100 rps.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_http_p99_seconds{path=\"sync\"} * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Synchronous HTTP P99.9",
      "description": "Exploratory target was below 500 ms, not a production SLO.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_http_p999_seconds{path=\"sync\"} * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 500
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Dropped iterations: requests never sent",
      "description": "Dropped iterations are excluded from HTTP success counts; zero unexpected errors among sent requests does not mean the offered load was handled.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_dropped_iterations",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Correctness probes: attempts vs issued",
      "description": "Oversell and duplicate scenarios deliberately reject most requests. Their HTTP QPS is not issuance capacity.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_http_requests{scenario=~\"oversell|duplicate\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} attempts",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_issued_coupons{scenario=~\"oversell|duplicate\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}} issued",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#5B8DEF"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Final inventory reconciliation (1 = passed)",
      "description": "After each run settled, issued coupons and Redis/MySQL remaining stock reconciled. This is a recorded observation, not a live audit.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_reconciled",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "MQ acceptance is not completed issuance",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The MQ run accepted **3,001** HTTP requests. The first post-run audit found **848** coupons committed; a later reconciliation reached **3,001** after about **22.9 seconds of polling**. That duration includes audit queries and is **not** a per-request delivery percentile.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MQ HTTP acceptance P99 / P99.9",
      "description": "These are queue-acceptance response times only.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_http_p99_seconds{path=\"mq\"} * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "P99 acceptance",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_http_p999_seconds{path=\"mq\"} * 1000",
          "legendFormat": "P99.9 acceptance",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "MQ first audit vs final issued",
      "description": "Two observations of committed coupons after the queue-acceptance test.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 34,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 6
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "coupon_benchmark_mq_first_audit_issued",
          "legendFormat": "First audit issued",
          "refId": "A",
