    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Settlement comparison: measurements still needed",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The r\u00e9sum\u00e9 describes **Redis Pipeline improving template reads by more than 2\u00d7** and a **synchronous settlement calculation about 20% faster than the multithreaded version**. No matching raw JMeter results were found in this workspace, so this dashboard does not present those percentages as measured facts. To add them, compare the same coupon counts and rules on the same machine, report completed throughput, P95/P99, errors, and the calculation result, then publish the raw summary and methodology.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
